WEBVTT

14:34.108 --> 14:35.901
Well...

14:37.611 --> 14:40.030
Look at me.

14:40.156 --> 14:43.284
You're a Stark of Winterfell.
You know our words.

14:45.703 --> 14:46.871
Winter is coming.

14:48.289 --> 14:52.084
You were born in the long summer.
You've never known anything else.

14:52.585 --> 14:54.503
But now winter is truly coming.

14:54.628 --> 14:58.591
And in the winter,
we must protect ourselves,

14:58.716 --> 15:00.092
look after one another.
